mutation a beat forgets which attempt it is for
detects NoStaleBeat
-     /\ IF status = "running" /\ attempts = att[w]
-        THEN age' = 0
+     /\ IF status = "running"
+        THEN age' = 0

mutation finish is fenced on the status only
detects NoStaleFinish
-     IF status \notin Ended /\ (~FencedFinish \/ attempts = att[w])
+     IF status \notin Ended

mutation start checks the status but a second dispatch of the attempt still starts
detects NoTwinAttempt
-     /\ IF FencedStart /\ ~(status = "queued" /\ attempts = att[w])
+     /\ IF FencedStart /\ ~(attempts = att[w])

mutation the reaper revives past MOST_ATTEMPTS
detects ReviveBound
-     /\ status = "running" /\ age = 3 /\ attempts < Most
+     /\ status = "running" /\ age = 3 /\ attempts < Most + 1

mutation a claim ignores a live lease
detects Exclusive
-        THEN holder' = w /\ lage' = 0 /\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![w] = "take"]
-        ELSE pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![w] = "busy"] /\ UNCHANGED lease
+        THEN holder' = w /\ lage' = 0 /\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![w] = "take"]
+        ELSE holder' = w /\ lage' = 0 /\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![w] = "take"]

mutation a dying container leaves its crawl process running (orphaned subprocess)
detects OneWriter
-     /\ mode' = [mode EXCEPT ![w] = "dead"] /\ proc' = [proc EXCEPT ![w] = FALSE] /\ faults' = faults + 1
-     /\ UNCHANGED <<run, pending, restarts, quiets, pc, att, ino, lease, dir, ghost>>
+     /\ mode' = [mode EXCEPT ![w] = "dead"] /\ faults' = faults + 1
+     /\ UNCHANGED <<run, pending, restarts, quiets, pc, att, proc, ino, lease, dir, ghost>>

mutation SourceBusy waits for every attempt, the first included, but finishes a carried-on one
detects NoSkippedRetry
-     /\ IF BusyWaits /\ att[w] > 0 THEN
+     /\ IF BusyWaits /\ att[w] = 0 THEN

mutation the reaper never carries a quiet crawl on
detects Settles
-     /\ status = "running" /\ age = 3 /\ attempts < Most
-     /\ status' = "queued"
+     /\ status = "running" /\ age = 3 /\ attempts < Most /\ FALSE
+     /\ status' = "queued"

mutation beat_at age is not capped
detects TypeOK
-     /\ age < 3
-     /\ ~\E w
+     /\ age < 4
+     /\ ~\E w
